<title>USA: National Golf buys Florida golf course.</title>
<headline>National Golf buys Florida golf course.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Golf Properties Inc said Tuesday it acquired Baymeadows Golf Course in Jacksonville, Fla., for about $4.5 million.</p>
<p>So far this year, the company has bought three golf courses for about $19 million.</p>
